  "citeAs": "Grossberg A, Elhalawani H, Mohamed A, Mulder S, Williams B, White AL, Zafereo J, Wong AJ, Berends JE, AboHashem S, Aymard JM, Kanwar A, Perni S, Rock CD, Chamchod S, Kantor M, Browne T, Hutcheson K, Gunn GB, Frank SJ, Rosenthal DI, Garden AS, Fuller CD, M.D. Anderson Cancer Center Head and Neck Quantitative Imaging Working Group. (2020) HNSCC Version 4 [Dataset] . The Cancer Imaging Archive. DOI: https://doi.org/10.7937/k9/tcia.2020.a8sh-7363",
